    "Your data is only on this iPhone. Choose an iCloud Drive folder: the app then backs up on its own, and you can restore it if you delete the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus datos solo están en este iPhone. Elige una carpeta de iCloud Drive: la app hará copias sola y podrás recuperarlos si borras la app."
          }
        },
        "gl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os teus datos só están neste iPhone. Escolle un cartafol de iCloud Drive: a app fará copias soa e poderás recuperalos se borras a app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data only leaves the phone when you share it, and only with the app you choose. It includes your notes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
